   353	# ==== Arm 8d (RED): THE KILLER — drop the count, add a member, rehash ========
   354	# The full defeat of the backstop, and the reason 8b is P2 and not cosmetic: a
   355	# re-pin that adds a member to the surface, updates the signed member list AND
